    <h1 style="margin-top:14px">One front door, organized around <em>the questions people bring</em></h1>
    <p class="dek">One way I've brought separate data and AI guidance together behind one front door, with the two disciplines side by side instead of blended. Shown through an invented transit agency.</p>
    <p class="tldr" data-aud="gen"><b>In short</b>When guidance lives on two sites, people have to guess which one holds the answer. This piece shows one way I've merged them: map everything, sort it by the questions people bring, and pair the two disciplines instead of blending them. It's an approach that has worked for me, not the only way to do it. The organization in it is invented.</p>
